@notes

Source: lect07c-prob_of_progeny_2.odp, slide 15.

=== layout: two-panels


@left

- Astronaut Jenna travels to a planet where they have three types of sexes\:
  - &#945; (alpha), &#946; (beta), and &#611; (gamma)
- with an equal probability of each sex
- Jenna meets a nice couple Kang and Kodos Johnson, who have 7 children
- What is the probability that they have exactly 3 &#945;, 2 &#946;, and 2 &#611;

