# *Dihybrid Cross*

@body

- A typical dihybrid cross produces a phenotype ratio of 9\:3\:3\:1.
- [What is the probability of obtaining exactly 9, 3, 3, and 1 from only 16 offspring in a dihybrid cross?]{color=red}

@notes

Source: lect07c-prob_of_progeny_2.odp, slide 31.

